---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Privacy Policy | Manage.Wedding",
  "url": "https://manage.wedding/privacy",
  "description": "Privacy Policy for Manage.Wedding. Learn how we prioritize user privacy through local in-browser data processing, zero-tracking guest list management, and transparent practices."
};
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy | Manage.Wedding"
	description="Privacy Policy for Manage.Wedding. Learn how we protect your personal information with local in-browser calculation and client-side data storage."
	schema={schema}
>
	<main style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(0.75rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); box-sizing: border-box;">
		
		<!-- Header -->
		<section class="section-paper" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;">
			<div style="padding: 2.5rem 1rem;">
				<div class="tape" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem;"></div>
				<h1 class="font-heading" style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); color: var(--fg-pencil); line-height: 1.15; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
					Privacy Policy
				</h1>
				<p class="font-body" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
					Last Updated: August 15, 2026 • Effective Date: January 1, 2026
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Main Privacy Document -->
		<article class="hand-card" style="padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #fff; line-height: 1.7; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
			
			<div style="background: #f0fdf4; border: 2px solid #16a34a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<strong class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #166534; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
					🛡️ Our Core Privacy Promise: Local-First Architecture
				</strong>
				<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #15803d; line-height: 1.5;">
					Manage.Wedding is built on a <strong>client-side, privacy-first foundation</strong>. Your guest names, catering budgets, wedding vows, speech drafts, seating chart arrangements, and financial numbers are processed directly inside your browser and stored in your device's local storage. We do not transmit or sell your wedding data.
				</p>
			</div>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					1. Information We Do Not Collect
				</h2>
				<p>
					Unlike traditional wedding planning platforms that require forced account registrations, passwords, and server synchronization, Manage.Wedding operates without mandatory user profiles:
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: square;">
					<li><strong>No Guest List Harvesting:</strong> Names, dietary requirements, phone numbers, and addresses entered into our Guest List Manager, RSVP Tracker, or Seating Chart remain on your device.</li>
					<li><strong>No Speech or Vow Logging:</strong> Speeches and vows pasted into the Wedding Speech Calculator are analyzed strictly by your browser's local JavaScript. No audio, text, or drafts are recorded.</li>
					<li><strong>No Financial Account Data:</strong> Financial figures entered into our Wedding Loan, Budget, or Vendor Tipping calculators are ephemeral calculations performed on your device.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					2. Information Stored in Your Browser (Local Storage)
				</h2>
				<p>
					To provide a seamless experience where you can close your browser tab and return without losing your progress, our applications utilize HTML5 LocalStorage:
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: square;">
					<li>Your custom checklist items and completion states.</li>
					<li>Saved seating tables and guest allocations.</li>
					<li>Active budget line items and expense entries.</li>
				</ul>
				<p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
					You have full control over this data. Clearing your browser cache or site data completely removes all stored entries from your machine.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					3. Standard Analytics & Server Logs
				</h2>
				<p>
					When you access Manage.Wedding, our web hosting servers automatically record non-identifying technical information strictly for website reliability, security, and performance optimization:
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: square;">
					<li>Internet Protocol (IP) address (anonymized/truncated).</li>
					<li>Browser type, operating system, and screen resolution.</li>
					<li>Pages visited, time spent per tool, and referring URLs.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					4. Affiliate Links & Advertising Disclosure
				</h2>
				<p>
					Manage.Wedding is reader-supported. Some pages (such as our Anniversary Gift Finder and Stationery tools) contain external affiliate links (e.g., Amazon.com Services LLC Associates Program). 
				</p>
				<p>
					If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you. These third-party merchants operate under their own independent privacy policies and cookie practices once you navigate to their platforms.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					5. Your Data Rights (GDPR & CCPA Compliance)
				</h2>
				<p>
					Under global privacy frameworks including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA):
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: square;">
					<li><strong>Right to Erase:</strong> You can purge all saved data at any time by clicking the "🗑️ Reset / Clear All" buttons on any calculator or clearing your browser's local storage.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to Portability:</strong> You can export your data in universal Word (.doc), PDF, and CSV formats via the 1-click export toolbars on each page.</li>
					<li><strong>Do Not Sell My Information:</strong> We do not sell, rent, or monetize your personal information to data brokers.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					6. Contact Us
				</h2>
				<p>
					If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or data security on Manage.Wedding, please contact our privacy team at:
				</p>
				<div style="background: var(--bg-paper); border: 1.5px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1rem; text-align: center;">
					<strong>Manage.Wedding Legal & Privacy Desk</strong><br />
					Email: <a href="mailto:manage.weddingall@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-blue);">manage.weddingall@gmail.com</a><br />
					Website: <a href="https://manage.wedding" style="color: var(--fg-pencil);">https://manage.wedding</a>
				</div>
			</section>

		</article>

	</main>
</Layout>
